      "id": "60e5ab89-483a-455f-8f69-3e23bb2a9fd0",
      "name": "Custom Field Definition",
      "description": {
        "content": "A **Custom Field Definition** describes a custom field - its name, type and which object it applies to (contract or project). Definitions are configured in Alasco and are read-only through this API.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
